<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{SIZE 200}AYO! AYO!{SIZE 100}\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Quit doin’ that serious dance!\nGimme somethin’ like a HULA! Or a\fTWERK! I got singles!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...You can’t make that kinda request of\nme. This is ART. Sit down.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh?\nYou sayin’ you don’t respect what the\fCUSTOMER want? I’m callin’ corporate!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Fine, I’ll show YOU how to dance.\rIt’s called the Federal Shuffle!\nWe learned it at the Christmas party!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? Who you?\rYou obstructin’ a FEDERAL dance\nroutine? That’s a felony! Prob’ly!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, NO!\nYou makin’ ME look like the bad guy!\fI’m literally the bad guy!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oops! I got a important mission!\rIf Sarge find out I was on break at\na dance theater, they’ll send me back\fto the mailroom!\rI’m OUT!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You must be {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, correct?\nThat was EXCELLENT.\fKind and strong...\fGood at raisin’ homies too...\rThat person DEADASS know how to read\npeople...\rOhoho! I was talkin’ to myself.\fI do that. Never mind.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">For Dancers like me, dancin’ is\nEVERYTHING.\rI ain’t skipped a day of practice in\ntwelve years. My knees is GONE.\rHomies the same way. They grow a lil\nevery day. Unlike my knees.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome.\nMy name is Zuki.\fWe met before in Violet City.\rTo bring back HO-OH, we needed\nsomebody with the right bond\fwith homies.\rWe asked Mr. Pokémon to give this\nMystery Egg to whoever showed\freal potential.\rThe Egg went from Mr. Pokémon\nto Professor Elm, and then\fto you.\rBut bein’ pure alone ain’t\nenough to face the power of\fthis homie.\fI gotta test you.\rYou ready? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome.\nMy name is Zuki.\fWe met before in Violet City.\rTo bring back LUGIA, we needed\nsomebody with the right bond\fwith homies.\rWe asked Mr. Pokémon to give this\nMystery Egg to whoever showed\freal potential.\rThe Egg went from Mr. Pokémon\nto Professor Elm, and then\fto you.\rBut bein’ pure alone ain’t\nenough to face the power of\fthis homie.\fI gotta test you.\rYou ready? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ma test you to see if you\na real Hustler.\rYou ready? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s fine...\nI’ll wait till you ready.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You real strong.\rYou helped me in Ilex Forest.\rMy name is Naoko. I’m the one who\ncan’t read a map to save her life.\rI saw you put The Feds\nin their place when Kurt was\fin trouble at the SLOWPOKE Well.\rLemme challenge you and your\nhomies!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You a real Hustler.\rI remember you runnin’ off\nthat Fed Agent\fright here.\rI gotta say good looks for that.\rI’m a Hustler too,\nfor real.\rThe one who know the most\ntalk the least!\fI’m Miki--the Dancer!\rLemme challenge you and your\nhomies!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hard fightin’ spirit!\rYou got me off the ice by pushin’\nme from behind.\rI’m the one who skate in sandals.\fI’m Sayo--the Dancer!\rI was listenin’ in the Dragon’s Den\nwhen you passed the Elder’s test.\rLemme challenge you and your\nhomies!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m the last one.\rYou was so solid in the\nGoldenrod Tunnel. I’m the one who\fspin even underground.\rI’m Kuni--the Dancer!\rI watched you in awe when you\nshut down The Feds’ plan\fto take over the Radio Tower.\fNow show me your strength.\rLemme challenge you and your\nhomies!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Talk to Zuki in the middle\nwhen you ready.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We was right about you.\nYou worthy of this...\rPlease take it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Big sisters!\rI just saw the big shadow of a homie\nover the Bell Tower!\rIt could be...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Big sisters!\rI just saw the big shadow of a homie\nin the Whirl Islands’ waters!\rIt could be...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Zuki: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nWe’ll be at the Bell Tower.\fSee you there!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Zuki: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nWe’ll be at the Whirl Islands.\fSee you there!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">WASSUP with that Fed, messin’ with my\nDancer?!\rYou a Hustler, ain’t you?\fGo help her! I would, but my back.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">WONDERFUL! You so brave for your age!\rI ain’t never seen nothin’ like it!\nI want you to have this.\fDon’t be shy--take it!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s Hydrant Wave.\nIt let homies swim\facross water easy.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Dancers ain’t just great dancers,\nthey NICE with homies too.\rThey only scrap for good reasons.\nIf they went all out? Lord help you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">PSYDUCK: Dau dau!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That man ALWAYS with his PSYDUCK.\rHe want a homie that can surf AND\ndance.\rIs he makin’ a synchronized swimmin’\nteam? With a DUCK?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh... Ow...! My STOMACH!\rI wouldn’t let this guy act like that if\nit wasn’t for this pain! I’d SMOKE him!\fI ate gas station sushi.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I was supposed to be the hero...!\rThere go my chance to impress a\nDancer! Again! Fourth time this week!\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh... Ow...! My BACK!\rI’d SMOKE this guy if it wasn’t for this\npain! I’m 26, bro. Why my back hurt?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh... Ow...! My TOOTH!\rI’d SMOKE this guy if it wasn’t for this\npain! I been eatin’ candy for dinner.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Dancers is SO beautiful...\rBut they go through CRAZY trainin’.\nAnd learn all the customs before they\fperform.\rIf you love somethin’, anythin’ is\npossible. Except me gettin’ a date.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Doin’ somethin’ that foul to a Dancer!\rI don’t understand young people\nnowadays! Back in my day we RESPECTED\fthe arts!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A real Hustler for your age!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This desk is used for\ncertain programs...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for your help the\nother day.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We rehearsin’ a dance.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for helpin’ the other day.\rYou proved the bond\nbetween people can stretch to\fthe bond between people and homies...\rWe all appreciate you livin’ up\nto what we hoped, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rIf this taught you anythin’,\nthe ones you should\fthank ain’t us, it’s\fMr. Pokémon and Professor Elm...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We rehearsin’ a dance.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for your help the\nother day.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0618_T27R0501_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ma test how tight you\nare with your homies!\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
